### Create a new game with a specific mode
POST  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/games HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
"players": [1, 2],
"mode": "rapide",
"difficulty": 2
}

### get a game
GET  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/games/5 HTTP/1.1

### update a game
PUT  https://localhost:4433/api/game-management-service/games/4 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
"local_players": ["me", "bob"]
}

### set a game result
### creation d'un gameHistory
POST https://localhost:4433/api/v2/database/myDb/table/gameHistory HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score1": 1,
  "player1": 1,
  "score2": 20,
  "player2": 2,
  "game": {"id":2}
}
### mise a jour du state du game
PUT https://localhost:4433/api/v2/database/myDb/table/game/id/2 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "terminee"
}
